This directory contains SWTBot-based automated GUI tests for the OpenJMLUI
Eclipse plugin.

The tests run inside a real Eclipse instance (downloaded automatically) and
exercise plugin installation, preferences, menus, LSP features, and project
nature functionality.

Key test classes are contained in src/org/jmlspecs/openjml/eclipse/uitest.

Setup (one-time):
  make fetch-eclipse          # Download Eclipse and install SWTBot features

Running tests:
  make run-install-test       # Run InstallPluginTest (installs the plugin)
  make run-tests              # Run all tests, except the one above

Environment variables:
  ECLIPSE_RELEASE    Eclipse version to download (default: 2026-03)
  ECLIPSE_HOME       Eclipse installation used for building tests
  UPDATE_SITE        p2 update site URL for OpenJML (default: local openjml.github.io path)

Platform notes:
  macOS: tested and supported
  Linux: requires xvfb-run for headless display
  Windows: not supported
